#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Starting a construction project implies a lot of important documents such as "
"contracts,\n"
"            building plans, instructions for use, subcontracting agreements, "
"etc. Instead of\n"
"            scattering them in your emails, storage services or computer, "
"attach them in the chatter\n"
"            and they will be automatically centralized in the<b>\n"
"                <strong>Documents App</strong>\n"
"            </b>."
msgstr ""
"Igangsættelsen af et byggeprojekt indebærer en lang række vigtige "
"dokumenter, herunder kontrakter,\n"
"byggetegninger, brugsanvisninger, underentreprisekontrakter osv. I stedet "
"for\n"
"at sprede dem ud i dine e-mails, lagringstjenester eller på din computer kan "
"du blot indsætte dem i chatteren,\n"
"så bliver de automatisk samlet i <b>\n"
"                <strong>Dokumenterappen</strong>\n"
"            </b>."

