#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>CRM module</strong> helps construction companies capture leads "
"from multiple\n"
"            sources, track communications, and schedule follow-ups.  <br/"
">You can prioritize\n"
"            high-value opportunities and turn inquiries into profitable "
"projects."
msgstr ""
"<strong>CRM-modulet</strong> hjælper byggefirmaer med at registrere leads "
"fra forskellige\n"
"            kilder, holde styr på kommunikationen og planlægge opfølgning. "
"<br/> De kan\n"
"            prioritere de mest lovende salgsmuligheder og omdanne "
"forespørgsler til rentable projekter."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Planning app</strong> schedules tasks, allocates employees, and "
"coordinates\n"
"            equipment use across multiple construction sites."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Planlægningsappen</strong> planlægger opgaver, tildeler medarbejdere "
"og koordinerer\n"
"            brugen af udstyr på flere byggepladser."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Projects App</strong> allows you to manage tasks, assign "
"resources, and\n"
"            create milestones for each construction project."
msgstr ""
"Med <strong>Projekterappen</strong> kan du administrere opgaver, tildele "
"ressourcer og\n"
"            oprette milepæle for hvert byggeprojekt."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <strong>Sales App</strong> enables rapid creation of professional "
"quotations.\n"
"            You can use product kits for materials, apply discounts, and "
"send polished proposals\n"
"            directly to clients."
msgstr ""
"Med <strong>Salgsappen</strong> kan du hurtigt udarbejde professionelle "
"tilbud.\n"
"Du kan bruge produktsæt til materialer, give rabatter og sende detaljerede "
"tilbud\n"
"direkte til kunderne."

#. module: construction
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid "The construction industries come in two parts:"
msgstr "Byggebranchen består af to dele:"

