#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:construction.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The default setting for billing is to invoice all recorded time sheets so "
"that your work can be invoiced directly.\n"
"                    You can however easily introduce a time sheet approval "
"process for manager to confirm and correct recorded time:"
msgstr ""
"Standardindstillingen for fakturering er, at alle registrerede "
"arbejdstidsopgørelser faktureres, så dit arbejde kan afregnes med det "
"samme.\n"
"                    Du kan dog nemt indføre en godkendelsesproces for "
"tidsregistreringer, så lederen kan bekræfte og rette de registrerede tider:"

